cation name is recorded here. 7. Shell history and command echo are suppressed for every credential command, and a post-ceremony scan of the repository, board resources, run logs, and shell history finds no secret value, key path, key ID, issuer ID, or account credential. 8. A TASK-ID-scoped outcome records which grants succeeded, which were declined, and any residual interaction the portal may still force later; a declined grant is recorded as a named blocker on the specific downstream task rather than as an assumed grant.
